    "title": "Arizona high school golfer chases unprecedented third straight state title - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nick King ,\n1 hours ago SCOTTSDALE, AZ (AZFamily) — In nearly a century of Arizona high school golf state championships, only about 15 boys have managed to win back-to-back individual titles. In two weeks, Notre Dame Prep senior Landon Ashcraft has the chance to make history as the first “big school” golfer and only the second overall to capture three consecutive state championships. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
